<title>USA: Airgas plans buyback of up to 1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Airgas plans buyback of up to 1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pennsylvania 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airgas Inc said on Monday its board had authorised the repurchase of up to one million shares of its common stock, which it said will be used to fund acquisitions and employee benefit plans.</p>
</text>
